ncy; requirements and allowances are handled by its office. The OAS posts announcements and updates when the agency requests it.','Department of Agriculture','government','agency_direct',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-11-21 12:45:02','2026-11-21 12:45:02',NULL,NULL,NULL),(9,'Agricultural Competitiveness Enhancement Fund - Grant-in-Aid for Higher Education Program (ACEF-GIAHEP)','ACEF-GIAHEP','For students taking agriculture, forestry, fisheries, veterinary medicine and related agricultural programs. Apply directly to the scholarship-giving agency; requirements and allowances are handled by its office. The OAS posts announcements and updates when the agency requests it.','Department of Agriculture','government','agency_direct',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-11-21 12:45:02','2026-11-21 12:45:02',NULL,NULL,NULL),(10,'Department of Science and Technology (DOST)','DOST','For students in priority science and technology fields: basic sciences, engineering, applied sciences, and science and mathematics education. Apply directly to the scholarship-giving agency; requirements and allowances are handled by its office. The OAS posts announcements and updates when the agency requests it.','Department of Science and Technology','government','agency_direct',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-11-21 12:45:02','2026-11-21 12:45:02',NULL,NULL,NULL),(11,'Local Government Unit-Bayugan (LGU-Bayugan) Graduate School Scholarship Program','LGU-Bayugan','Apply directly to the scholarship-giving agency; requirements and allowances are handled by its office. The OAS posts announcements and updates when the agency requests it.','Local Government Unit of Bayugan','government','agency_direct',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-11-21 12:45:02','2026-11-21 12:45:02',NULL,NULL,NULL),(12,'The National Grid Corporation of the Philippines (NGCP) Scholarship Program','NGCP','For engineering students, with priority to BS Electric